      "content": "If you are feeling like disappearing is easier than facing this shame, please know that there are people who want to support you right now. You do not have to carry this immense weight alone; reaching out for immediate help can make a difference. Please consider calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada, or calling 111 in the UK. These services are free, confidential, and available 24/7.",
      "source": "target",
